I've been taking a bit of a break from 14 recently and exploring other games; 

Warhammer is a new interest so exploring both 40k and fantasy. Think fantasy is more my thing rn.

Dressmaker has been fun to pass time with and just picked up Control Resonant and thats been really good so far.

Control Resonant is so friggin good. I'm glad that 
@remedygames.com 
 still can not only get me hyped for a game, but I retain my hype while I'm playing it. They're one of the few companies whos games still keep me completely hooked.

@remedygames.com btw, there is no Baltimore, MA. 
Just Baltimore, MD.
